      "comment": "PUMP FAKE (1) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (16.43) at this track behind New Hope in a Grade 6. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Capable of going well again. MAYDAY MAYDAY (2) turned spotting a big start finishing fifth (16.57) last time in a Grade 5/6 at this track. Solid record at the distance winning five races. Can figure in the finish. TORI KEEPING (4) copped a check in the run and finished a well held 13 lengths eighth (16.73) last time in a Grade 5 at this track over 275m. May be worth another try. EPIC MARCELINE (6) was unplaced here last start but gets her chance to atone.",
